cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
authors:
- family-names: "Hickman"
  given-names: "Oscar"
title: "galform_analysis: Python tools for analysing GALFORM galaxy formation model outputs"
version: 0.4.0
date-released: 2026-10-13
url: "https://github.com/OscarHickman/galform_analysis"
repository-code: "https://github.com/OscarHickman/galform_analysis"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - galform
  - galaxy formation
  - semi-analytic model
  - cosmology
abstract: >-
  Python tools for reading the galaxies.hdf5 files written by the GALFORM
  galaxy formation model and measuring stellar and halo mass functions,
  luminosity functions with GALFORM's dust attenuation, halo occupation
  distributions, two-point correlation functions (including corrections for
  using only some subvolumes), galaxy bias and redshift-space multipoles.
